<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Amit Labs Studio</title>

    <meta name="description"
          content="Amit Labs Studio - Independent developer creating apps and digital projects.">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #0f1115;
            color: #f2f2f2;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        header {
            padding: 24px 7%;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #252832;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 100px 7%;
        }

        .hero {
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 72px);
            line-height: 1.05;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #6ea8ff;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 19px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #aeb3bf;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 22px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #6ea8ff;
            color: #0f1115;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .section {
            margin-top: 120px;
        }

        .section h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .section p {
            color: #aeb3bf;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .coming-soon {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 25px;
            border: 1px solid #292d38;
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: #aeb3bf;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 100px;
            padding: 30px 7%;
            border-top: 1px solid #252832;
            color: #777d89;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">Amit Labs Studio</div>
</header>

<main>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>
            Building things<br>
            <span>worth using.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
            Amit Labs Studio is an independent developer studio
            creating apps and digital projects based on curiosity,
            experimentation, and useful ideas.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="#projects">
            Explore Projects
        </a>
    </section>


    <section class="section" id="projects">
        <h2>Projects</h2>

        <p>
            New projects are currently being developed.
        </p>

        <div class="coming-soon">
            Projects coming soon.
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="section">
        <h2>About</h2>

        <p>
            Amit Labs Studio is an independent development studio
            focused on creating software, experimenting with new
            ideas, and building things around personal interests.
        </p>
    </section>

</main>

<footer>
    © 2026 Amit Labs Studio. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
